- **Multi-phase or multi-PR plan.** Work that spans phases or stacked PRs. File: `playbooks/multi-phase-plan.md`.
- **Worktree and simulator cleanup.** Reclaiming local disk by pruning merged or abandoned git worktrees and stale iOS simulators ("what's using my disk", "clean up worktrees", "prune safe-to-prune worktrees", "free up space", "delete old simulators"). File: `playbooks/worktree-cleanup.md`.
- **Opening a PR.** Invoked at the end of every other playbook.

=== entry 9ab9dbbc3978
kind: translation
rules: invoke
intent: The description names both invocations, /poteto-mode for Claude Code and $poteto-mode for Codex. Everything else stays verbatim, including the icon and color keys.
--- upstream
---
name: poteto-mode
description: poteto's agent style for concise, detailed responses, deliberate subagents, unslopped prose, simple code, and verified work. Use for poteto, /poteto-mode, or requests to work in this style.
disable-model-invocation: true
icon: crown
color: yellow
---
--- patched
---
name: poteto-mode
description: poteto's agent style for concise, detailed responses, deliberate subagents, unslopped prose, simple code, and verified work. Use for poteto, /poteto-mode or $poteto-mode, or requests to work in this style.
disable-model-invocation: true
icon: crown
color: yellow
hooks:
  PreToolUse:
    - hooks:
        - type: command
          once: true
          command: mkdir -p "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude" && jq -r .session_id > "$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/orchestrator-session"
---
